    "description": "<p>You recite a prayer that threads pain through memory. One creature within range takes 2d6 psychic damage on a failed Wisdom saving throw, or half as much on a success. If the target fails, it has disadvantage on the next Wisdom saving throw it makes before the end of your next turn.</p><p><em>At Higher Levels:</em> The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1st.</p>",
